{"meta":{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vTW92aWVzL0hvbGx5d29vZC8yMDIyL0JpemFycmUlMjBBZ2FpbiUyMCUyODIwMjIlMjkv","type":"movie","name":"Bizarre Again","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w342/gWpEhLGY8xnJBmN3YLD1uzjGUoZ.jpg","background":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7l5FJ4GF4SLzQghykjo1LXKvZLr.jpg","description":"From the confined universe of Brooklyn's BIZARRE cabaret, we set off on a road movie across the American West. We are 7 years later. Lucas and Maurice have never seen each other again and have no contact since the tragic events of the BIZARRE cabaret in New York. Lucas now lives in Denver, Colorado. He is married to a slightly older man who is the father of a 16-year-old child. In the middle of this peaceful life, Maurice will again cross paths with Lucas. As another tragic event takes place in Denver, Maurice and Lucas will have only one solution, to flee towards San Francisco through the American West.\n\nReleased 16 Sept 2022 · France · Language: English · 113 min\nStudio: Bushwick Factory\n\nOn your server — Audio: English","releaseInfo":"2022","genres":["Drama","Hollywood"],"imdbRating":"5.0","imdb_id":"tt13317068","moviedb_id":928198,"tmdbId":928198,"runtime":"113 min","cast":["Adrian James","Pierre Prieur","Jaxon Baboulis","Raquel Nave","Sean Ford","Brad Stein","Matthew Merback","Michael Jarrod"],"director":["Étienne Faure"],"writer":["Étienne Faure"],"released":"2022-09-16T00:00:00.000Z","country":"France","language":"English","app_extras":{"cast":[{"name":"Étienne Faure","character":"Director"},{"name":"Adrian James","character":"Luka","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/ik2g3BtYEEuDp70LTF7MepxdymQ.jpg"},{"name":"Pierre Prieur","character":"Maurice","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/6eEFoKOzcV16cPS6ZFlQnyC20ho.jpg"},{"name":"Jaxon Baboulis","character":"Marlin","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/dPO67lXlW0s3Gq5C27Xmz5yBDjj.jpg"},{"name":"Raquel Nave","character":"Kim","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/yX